[2.460586, "o", "  \u001b[1mFilters\u001b[0m  (1 hooks)  \u001b[2msrc/Filters.tsx\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[33mwarn \u001b[0m  cross-component-infinite-loop  [hook:0]  \u001b[2m(line 4:2)\u001b[0m  this effect calls `onChange`, a state setter of parent `Dashboard` (its deps do not provably gate it, so the effect can re-run every render). Parent re-renders → child re-renders → effect fires again: infinite loop\r\n\u001b[2m   1 clean component(s) hidden, rerun with --show-clean\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[33m⚠  1 warning(s) across 2 file(s).\u001b[0m\r\n"]
